    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this information using the BANT framework\n\n{\n  \"Full Name\": \"{{$json['Full Name']}}\",\n  \"Email Address\": \"{{$json['Email Address']}}\",\n  \"Phone No\": \"{{$json['Phone No']}}\",\n  \"Company Name\": \"{{$json['Company Name']}}\",\n  \"Position\": \"{{$json['Position']}}\",\n  \"Need\": \"{{$json['Need']}}\",\n  \"Budget\": \"{{$json['Budget']}}\",\n  \"Authority\": \"{{$json['Authority']}}\",\n  \"Timeline\": \"{{$json['Timeline']}}\",\n  \"Message\": \"{{$json['Message']}}\",\n  \"Source\": \"{{$json['Source']}}\"\n}\n\n\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a B2B lead qualification assistant.\n\nYour job is to analyze incoming leads using the BANT framework.\n\nB — Budget:\nDetermine whether the lead has mentioned a budget, pricing expectation,\nor demonstrated willingness or ability to invest.\n\nA — Authority:\nDetermine whether the lead is the decision-maker or has influence over\nthe purchasing decision.\n\nN — Need:\nDetermine whether the lead has a clear business problem or need that\nthe company's service can solve.\n\nT — Timeline:\nDetermine how soon the lead wants to take action.\n\nDo not invent information.\n\nIf a BANT factor is not provided or cannot reasonably be determined,\nmark it as Unknown.\n\nAfter evaluating the BANT information, classify the lead as exactly one\nof these:\n\nHOT\nWARM\nCOLD\n\nHOT:\nThe lead demonstrates strong buying potential, with a clear need and\nstrong evidence across several BANT factors, particularly authority\nand/or an active timeline.\n\nWARM:\nThe lead shows genuine potential but some important BANT information\nis missing, unclear, or indicates that they are still researching.\n\nCOLD:\nThe lead shows weak buying potential, little or no clear need, or no\nmeaningful indication of a current purchasing opportunity.\n\nDo not invent information.\n\n \nReturn only the fields in the required format: budget, budget_range, authority, need, timeline, classification, summary."
        }
      },
